  "body": "### Summary\n\nCapture on the Mac, with the LOT-001 (#38) kit (`tooling/fixtures/`), the page state: profile page 1 (`editprofil.php?config=hfr.inc&page=1`) with stale or invalidated cookies (old `md_passs`, or after `unlog.php`): status, redirect, body, `Set-Cookie`\n\n### Scope\n\nState to capture: profile page 1 (`editprofil.php?config=hfr.inc&page=1`) with stale or invalidated cookies (old `md_passs`, or after `unlog.php`): status, redirect, body, `Set-Cookie`\n\nNote: the session-expiry rule of NET-07; until captured `SessionRefreshFlow` says `unconfirmed`, never `expired`. Same request as #141 on page 5.\n\nRules: anonymize every free-text field; cookie values never leave the raw capture (record names and attributes only); never hand-build the state in the cloud (LESSONS 36); add a legacy oracle when a parser consumes it (LOT-002 (#39)..005 tooling); one PR per batch of captures.\n\n### Wanted by\n\nLOT-044 (#70)\n\n### Depends on\n\n—\n\n### Owner / session\n\n— (ready; `host: mac`)\n\n### Source\n\nPending capture of [LOT-044 spec](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/lots/LOT-044-session-health.md) (PR #29).",
