   "body": "### Capture result\nCorpus: `R70c` (page 1, wrong `md_passs`), `R71b` (no cookie), `R72a`/`R72b` (`unlog.php`); PR #386 (`capture/session-expiry`).\nStale cookies on page 1: 200, no redirect, no `Set-Cookie`, `.hop` \"Identifiants invalides !\" refreshing to `/unlog.php?config=hfr.inc` (same bytes on home, flags page, page 5). `unlog.php` **without** its `codehex` is a no-op (200, empty body), and the session stays valid. `md_passs` did not change across two logins, so it is not a per-login token.\nChanges: LOT-044 `SessionExpiry` case (NET-07), #383.",
